@startuml dominio_pagamento
!include dss-dominio.iuml
skinparam minClassWidth 120
title View 5 - Payment instruments (subset of dominio.puml)

class "Customer Card" as CustomerCard
class "Food Product" as FoodProduct
class "Item Registration" as ItemRegistration {
  registeredAt : DateTime
  unitPrice : Decimal
}
class "Bank Card Payment" as BankCardPayment
class "Cash Payment" as CashPayment
class "Meal Card Payment" as MealCardPayment
class "Voucher Payment" as VoucherPayment
class "Card Balance Payment" as CardBalancePayment
class "Return Voucher" as ReturnVoucher {
  amount : Decimal
}
class Payment {
  amount : Decimal
  sequence : Integer
}

Payment "*" -- "1" Purchase : settles >
Purchase "1" -- "*" ItemRegistration : contains >
ItemRegistration "*" -- "1" Product : of >
FoodProduct -up- Product : is a >
BankCardPayment -up- Payment : is a >
CashPayment -up- Payment : is a >
MealCardPayment -up- Payment : is a >
VoucherPayment -up- Payment : is a >
CardBalancePayment -up- Payment : is a >
VoucherPayment "*" -- "1" ReturnVoucher : redeems >
CardBalancePayment "*" -- "1" CustomerCard : draws on >

note right of Payment
  sequence = order of application (D16):
  return vouchers, meal card, card balance,
  then bank card / cash.
  Cancelled purchase (D19): voucher and card-balance
  payments undone; bank card / cash follow the store
  refund process (outside the system).
end note
note bottom of MealCardPayment
  Amount <= value of the not-voided Food Product
  lines, after their discounts (D17).
end note
note bottom of ReturnVoucher
  Arrives already issued (D18). Single use;
  unused remainder is lost; restored if the
  purchase is cancelled (D19).
end note
@enduml
